2:5	compose:content-emitter-returning-values-check	manual	Composable functions should either emit content into the composition or return a value, but not both.\nIf a composable should offer additional control surfaces to its caller, those control surfaces or callbacks should be provided as parameters to the composable function by the caller.\nSee https://mrmans0n.github.io/compose-rules/rules/#do-not-emit-content-and-return-a-result for more information.
